## Assignment:

Create a class `Car` that extends `Vehicle` with:
- An extra field `doors` (number) set via constructor
- Override `describe()` to return `"<year> <make> (<doors> doors)"`

Create a class `Motorcycle` that extends `Vehicle` with:
- No extra fields
- Override `describe()` to return `"<year> <make> (motorcycle)"`

